Petal & Co.
Petal & Co. started with a simple frustration: skincare shouldn't require a chemistry degree to understand.
We make small-batch, fragrance-free skincare using formulas we can actually explain — no filler ingredients, no 12-step routines, no pretending more steps means better skin.
Every product we make answers one question honestly: does this actually do something for your skin, or does it just look nice on a shelf? If it's the second one, we don't make it.
Founded in a small kitchen and now shipped across India, Petal & Co. is built for people who want their skincare to work quietly in the background — so they can get on with their day.
